.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rosregview-find 1  "rosregview-find "
.SH NAME
rosregview\-find \- Search the key hierarchy for keys with names matching `\-n` (substring, repeatable, any\-of, case\-insensitive by default) and/or values whose name+decoded\-data contains `\-v`. With no filters, this enumerates every key path up to `\-\-max\-depth`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrosregview find\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-value\fR] [\fB\-\-case\-sensitive\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search the key hierarchy for keys with names matching `\-n` (substring, repeatable, any\-of, case\-insensitive by default) and/or values whose name+decoded\-data contains `\-v`. With no filters, this enumerates every key path up to `\-\-max\-depth`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-name\fR \fI<PATTERN>\fR
Substring to match in key names. Repeat to OR multiple patterns
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-value\fR \fI<PATTERN>\fR
Substring to match in value name + decoded data (any value within a matching key whose name/data contains the pattern)
.TP
\fB\-\-case\-sensitive\fR
Match case\-sensitively. Default: case\-insensitive
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR \fI<N>\fR
Limit recursion depth. 0 = root only, 1 = root + direct children, ... Default: unlimited
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: human]
Output format (`human` is a path list, `json` is machine\-readable)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
Path to a .hiv file (Windows registry configuration unit)
